      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">How does hydraulic ramp loading ensure zero scratches during Car Transportation In Gandhidham?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Hydraulic ramps provide a smooth, level platform that eliminates the need for manual winches or chains, which can mar a vehicle’s finish. The ramps are equipped with anti‑slip surfaces and precise height control, allowing the car to glide onto the carrier without impact. Combined with padded wheel chocks and ratchet lashings, the system secures the vehicle while preserving paintwork, guaranteeing a zero‑scratch guarantee throughout the journey.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">What documents are required for IBA‑approved GST bills and insurance when shipping a car from Gandhidham?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">To generate an IBA‑approved GST bill, you need the vehicle’s registration certificate, a valid government‑issued ID, and the PAN of the owner or the corporate entity. For full‑coverage transit insurance, provide the same registration proof, a copy of the insurance policy (if any), and a declared value invoice. These documents enable seamless claim processing and reimbursement for corporate or government moves.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Can I track my vehicle in real time during the 850 km transit from Gandhidham to major hubs?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Yes. Every carrier in our fleet is fitted with a satellite‑linked GPS unit that streams live location data to a secure portal. Customers receive instant notifications on departure, checkpoint arrivals, and estimated time of arrival. The system also logs speed, route deviations, and temperature, ensuring full transparency and peace of mind throughout the 850 km journey.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">How are different vehicle categories (hatchback, sedan, SUV, luxury) priced in the Gandhidham car quote?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Pricing is tiered based on vehicle dimensions, weight, and handling requirements. Hatchbacks and sedans fall under the standard slab, while SUVs incur a modest surcharge for extra space and heavier load. Luxury and high‑value cars attract a premium for specialized cradles, additional padding, and higher insurance coverage. All rates are disclosed in the transparent Gandhidham Car Quote before booking.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Is it possible to ship my car via Indian Railway from Gandhidham, and how does it compare to road transport?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Indian Railway does offer vehicle transport, but it involves longer lead times, limited pickup points, and additional handling that can increase the risk of minor dents. Road‑based Car Transportation In Gandhidham provides door‑to‑door service, real‑time GPS tracking, and a zero‑scratch guarantee with hydraulic ramps, making it faster, safer, and more convenient for most customers.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">What safety measures are taken for high‑value or antique cars during Car Transportation In Gandhidham?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">High‑value and antique vehicles receive bespoke handling: custom‑built wooden crates, 7‑layer shock‑absorbent packaging, and dedicated hydraulic ramps with soft‑edge guards. Each car is secured with high‑tensile ratchet lashings and monitored by 24/7 CCTV in our enclosed container trucks. Full‑coverage, IRDAI‑approved marine transit insurance further protects against any unforeseen loss or damage.</p>
      </div>
  </div>
